						"description": "In your Movement phase, if this unit is not battle-shocked, you can make a psychic roll for this unit by rolling one D6. If you do:\n• On a 1, this unit is battle-shocked.\n• Select one visible enemy unit within 12\". That enemy unit cannot make Snap shooting attacks.",
						"name": "Murderous Hurricane",
						"type": "Datasheet"
					},
					{
						"description": "When an enemy unit targets this unit, if this unit is not battle-shocked, you can make a psychic roll for this unit by rolling one D6. If you do:\n• On a 1, this unit is battle-shocked.\n• This unit has -3\" detection range until the end of the phase.",
						"name": "Storm Caller",
						"type": "Datasheet"
					},
					{
						"description": "In your Shooting phase, if this unit is not battle-shocked, you can make a psychic roll for this unit by rolling one D6. If you do:\n• On a 1, this unit is battle-shocked.\n• Select one visible enemy unit within 18\". That enemy unit is suppressed until the start of your next turn:\n• While a unit is suppressed, that unit's attacks have -1 to hit rolls.",
						"name": "Tempest's Wrath",
						"type": "Datasheet"
